# Modules listed here are copied into the initramfs *and loaded unconditionally*
# at every boot, before the root file system is mounted. Nothing is listed: on a
# Celeron N4100 the forced `modprobe amdgpu` alone took 6.0 s of the kernel phase
# on a machine without an AMD GPU (3.9 s on an N5105), and the root mount waited
# for it (image/reports/hostboot-2026-10-12.md).
#
# The KMS drivers for the splash and the live installer's modules are added
# without being loaded by hooks/retroboot-modules; udev loads a KMS driver when
# its device is present, and the live script (scripts/retroboot-live) loads the
# installer's own.
